        <mxCell id="b_f5" value="&lt;b&gt;Human Authorization (ADR-002)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Federation certified agronomist reviews AI confidence &amp;amp; photos&lt;br/&gt;• Authorizes fumigation prescription as human with MFA&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Order &amp;amp; Case Progression&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Updates case to &lt;i&gt;focus_confirmed&lt;/i&gt;; verification flight closes case&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Traceability &amp;amp; Origin Audit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Immutable DynamoDB audit trail (5-year retention)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#334155;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2205" y="825" width="370" height="265" as="geometry" />
