        <mxCell id="b_ff3" value="• 14-day retention SQS DLQ per function (&lt;i&gt;infconfirmdlq&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;infverifydlq&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;• 3 adaptive SDK retries to Bedrock; maxReceiveCount 5 to DLQ (ASM-162)&lt;br/&gt;• CloudWatch DLQ alarm triggers rollback (ASM-229)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7f1d1d;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
